    "preamble": "Naushad Yasin Patel vs The State Of Maharashtra And Anr on 10 December, 2018 Author: Sarang V. Kotwal Bench: B. P. Dharmadhikari, Sarang V. Kotwal 1/3 04-WP-1098-16-&-Ors.odt In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Criminal Writ Petition No.1098 Of 2016 Raju Laxman Pacchapure .... Petitioner versus The State of Maharashtra & Anr. ... Respondents With Criminal Writ Petition No.1150 Of 2015 Naushad Yasin Patel .... Petitioner versus The State of Maharashtra & Anr. ... Respondents With Criminal Writ Petition No.1165 Of 2015 Abdul Rahim Abdul Rehman .... Petitioner versus The State of Maharashtra & Anr. ... Respondents .......",
